# Data A: check out code and sheets with LF on every system. The build writes clean.py with LF and a test compares it
# byte for byte, and sheet hashes are taken over LF bytes, so a Windows CRLF checkout fails both. This folder only.
# The gold CSVs are left out on purpose: they are stored with CRLF, and their sha256 is recorded in the harm reports.
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.parquet binary
